<p class="crumbs"><a href="/components">Phlex</a></p>
<h1>Phlex in ERB</h1>
<p class="lead">
  An ERB template rendering Phlex components with <code>&lt;%= render Components::Badge.new(genre) %&gt;</code>.
  Their HTML isn't escaped, though this app's ERB escapes <code>&lt;%= %&gt;</code>.
</p>

<p>
  <% GENRES.each do |genre| %>
    <%= render Components::Badge.new(genre, tone: genre.downcase.tr(" ", "-")) %>
  <% end %>
</p>

<div class="grid">
  <% movies.each do |movie| %>
    <%= render Components::MovieCard.new(movie) %>
  <% end %>
</div>
